    "title": "Belmont Field Hockey Takes Down Long-Time Nemesis Watertown, 2-1, In Season Opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Franklin B. Tucker ,\n1 days ago Photo: Teammates surround Belmont High School goalie Zoe Bruce after the Marauders’ 2-1 victory over Watertown. It was a long time coming. A pair of goals from senior captain Elsie Lakin-Schultz and a near flawless performance (10 saves) by junior goalie Zoe Bruce (10 saves) highlighted a complete team effort from the 12th-ranked Belmont High Field Hockey in defeating the 22 time state champions and 9th-ranked Watertown High Raiders, 2-1, in the season opener for both teams on Sept. 9. Read full article",
